{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","萨基塔里斯"],["/names/en","Dionel"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名卓越超群的射手，能在友军的支援下发挥强大作用，并持续制造大量范围伤害。"],["/description_i18n/en","An outstanding Marksman who makes a big difference under allied reinforcement and continuously deals massive AoE damage."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哦？有人想来一杯吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Anyone up for a drink?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","多谢。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Many thanks."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","随心所欲地——贯穿一切吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Run through everything!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","这也在所难免……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","This was... inevitable..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","胜利的滋味最为芳醇。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","The sweetest taste is victory!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","来吧，朋友，与我共饮吧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Come, friend. Partake with me!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","有人呼唤我，是宴会吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Did someone call for me? Is there a feast?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","真是无聊啊，味道不错。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I'm bored... *Drinks* This isn't bad."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","要是能不靠我出手，那可就谢天谢地了，不是吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Wouldn't it be great if you didn't have to rely on me?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","圣洁之物总是美得超乎寻常，不是吗？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Sacred items always hold extraordinary beauty, don't they?"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","不错，偶尔拿出来把玩一下，也算解闷。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Not bad. I'll try it out now and then to pass the time."],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","唉，这东西太丑陋了，还是把它扔远些吧。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/en","Alas, it's hideous. I should throw it away..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要不要来一场宴会？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Should we throw a party?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","还远远没有尽兴呢！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","I haven't had enough fun yet!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来吧，尽情干杯吧，朋友！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Bottoms up, my friend!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","棒极了！这才是节日！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This is what a true holiday feels like!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","来吧，尽情干杯吧，朋友！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Bottoms up, my friend!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来吧，一起庆祝吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Come, let's celebrate together!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","令人激情澎湃！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Such passion fills the air!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一起欣赏这焰火吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Watch as the fireworks ignite the heavens!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","萨基塔利斯的舌头能品出岩山上的泉水和深潭里的湖水的区别，据他自己说“平衡和口感有很大的区别”。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Dionel can distinguish between mountain spring and pond water, emphasizing the significant taste and balance differences."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","尽管萨基塔利斯经常迟到，但很奇妙的，他从来没耽误过任何事。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Dionel is usually late, but strangely, he has never caused a delay to anything."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","“世界上最有意义的事情就是去思考一些毫无意义的事。”——萨基塔利斯的这句狡辩后来成为了哲学家们经久不衰的议题。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","\"The most meaningful thing in this world is to contemplate some meaningless things,\" says Dionel, a statement that has become a lasting topic among philosophers."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","据说在当年战争前线有一处湖泊，是萨基塔利斯远远掷出手中武器击溃敌方大军留下的坑洞形成的。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Legend has it that a lake appeared on the battlefield when Dionel hurled his weapon at the enemy troops."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","比起速度，慵懒的萨基塔利斯更擅长技巧，但不知为何所有人都觉得他应该拥有卓绝的速度。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Despite being lazy, Dionel excels in technique compared to his speed. Strangely, everyone believes he should possess shocking speed, which he doesn't really have."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","萨基塔利斯对于颜色和艺术风格的喜好一年一个样——这也造就了他还活跃在世间时所谓的“年度流行”。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Dionel's color and art style preferences change every year, making him an active trendsetter."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特村中的莎拉奶奶至今津津乐道着自己少女时期，在附近山中遇险时被一个“优雅而闪亮”的美男子所救的事情。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","In Marilee's village, Grandma Sara loves recounting the tale of being saved by a \"graceful and glowing\" handsome man in the mountains when she was a young maiden."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","萨基塔利斯的雷电会击穿你的心脏——在他真正驾临前线之前，很多人还以为这只是又一句浪漫的情诗。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","\"Dionel's lightning bolt will pierce through your heart.\" Many initially dismissed it as another romantic story until Dionel took it to the frontlines."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","“你的生命不值一提。”萨基塔利斯在干掉某个以残虐为名的大恶魔时曾经这样说过，“但结束倒还算得上艺术。”"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","\"Your life is not worth mentioning,\" said Dionel after defeating a tyrannical Hypogean, \"but the end of it is rather tasteful.\""],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","萨基塔利斯在半神里是出了名的无拘无束和平易近人，很少有人见过他真正的狂怒姿态。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Among all the Celestials, Dionel is the most carefree and approachable. Very few have witnessed him getting angry."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","好无聊啊，既然之前的事情告一段落，我们来一场宴会庆祝下如何？"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","I'm bored. Since everything's fine now, how about we celebrate with a party?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415014.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415014.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","……如上所述，进食既非必要，又是浪费时间的举动。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","...As mentioned above, eating is both unnecessary and a waste of time."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Scarlita & Dionel"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","啊，萨基塔里斯！你又在这里偷懒！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Dionel! You're slacking off again!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415032.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415032.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","塔琳 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Talene & Dionel"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","老朋友，这么长时间没见，你没有变啊，依然如此……无趣。"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Ah, old friend! It's been ages, and you're still the same—just as dull as ever."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415039.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415039.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 顿里尔"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Dunlingr"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","要不要来一场宴会？"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Should we throw a party?"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415142.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415142.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Dionel"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","来吧，尽情干杯吧，朋友！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Bottoms up, my friend!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415143.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415143.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Dionel"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","看，这里完全变了个模样！充满了隆冬节的氛围！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Look at this place! It's practically buzzing with Winter Carnival vibes! The lights, the food, the drink... it's perfect!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415346.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415346.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 塔琳"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Talene"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","棒极了！这才是节日！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","This is what a true holiday feels like!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415459.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415459.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Dionel"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","来吧，一起庆祝吧！"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Come, let's celebrate together!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415460.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415460.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Dionel"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","噢，两位可爱的小朋友。你们的双人舞真是华丽优雅，与这欢乐的庭会相得益彰。"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Ah, what an adorable pair! Your duet dance is so graceful, so grand. It's like you two were born to light up this party!"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415480.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415480.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 伊莱亚和莱拉"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Elijah & Lailah"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","令人激情澎湃！"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","Such passion fills the air!"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415637.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415637.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Dionel"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","一起欣赏这焰火吧！"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","Watch as the fireworks ignite the heavens!"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415638.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415638.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Dionel"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","难得遇到你啊，朋友，我还以为你这会儿又在开宴会呢。"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","It's a rare opportunity to see you here, my friend. I thought you were busy hosting another party."],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415666.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415666.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","巴赫朗 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Baelran & Dionel"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","奥菲戈斯，你拒绝了我的宴会邀请，却出现在了梅林这里。"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/en","Really, Sylphira? You turn down an invitation to my banquet only to turn up here at Merlin's?"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415763.json"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415763.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 奥菲戈斯"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Sylphira"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，我发现了一封请柬，信里邀请我们去宴会！"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/en","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, look! I found an invitation for a banquet!"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414080.json"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414080.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Dionel"],["/interaction_records/14/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/14/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德，你注意到了吗？"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/en","Scarlita, are you paying attention?"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414140.json"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414140.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","我曾经，有个朋友。"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/en","I once had a friend."],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414150.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414150.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/en","Scarlita & Dionel"]]}